@startuml get-manager-coffee-chat-request
skinparam defaultFontName "Apple SD Gothic Neo", "Noto Sans CJK KR", sans-serif
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign left
skinparam maxMessageSize 260
skinparam BoxPadding 8
skinparam shadowing false
autonumber
hide footbox

title GET /api/manager/v1/coffee-chat/request
caption CRB-45 · 커피챗 요청 목록 (읽기 전용). 공유된 연락처는 조회하지 않음

actor Client
participant "ManagerGuard" as Guard
participant "ValidationPipe" as Pipe
participant "ManagerCoffeeChatController" as Controller
participant "ManagerCoffeeChatService" as Service
participant "AdminCoffeeChatRequestRepository" as RequestRepository
database PostgreSQL

Client -> Guard: GET /api/manager/v1/coffee-chat/request?status&created_from&created_to&student_pk&student_name&graduated_pk&graduated_nickname&page&size\nAuthorization: Bearer <manager token>
ref over Client, Guard: ManagerGuard — flow/manager-guards.puml\n401 Missing access token / Token expired / Invalid token / Manager not found
Guard -> Pipe: 통과
alt query 검증 실패 (status · 날짜 · uuid 형식, 빈 검색어, page · size 범위)
  Pipe -[#red]-> Client: 400 (class-validator 메시지)
end
Pipe -> Controller: listRequests(query)
Controller -> Service: listRequests(query)
alt created_from이 created_to보다 늦음
  Service -[#red]-> Client: 400 created_from must not be after created_to
end
Service -> RequestRepository: findPage(filter, offset, limit)
RequestRepository -> PostgreSQL: SELECT 요청 + 재학생 이름 · 요청 당시 학과 + 현업자 닉네임 · 회사 · 직무\nORDER BY created_at DESC, pk DESC LIMIT OFFSET
PostgreSQL --> RequestRepository: rows
RequestRepository -> PostgreSQL: SELECT count(*) (같은 조건)
PostgreSQL --> RequestRepository: total
note right of RequestRepository
  shared_phone · shared_email은 SELECT하지 않음.
  상태는 시각 컬럼으로 계산: contact_shared_at → graduated_viewed_at 순
  탈퇴 처리 후에는 이름이 null이라 이름 검색에 걸리지 않으므로 student_pk로 찾음
end note
RequestRepository --> Service: { rows, total }
Service --> Controller: PageResponseDto<CoffeeChatRequestDto>
Controller --> Client: 200 { items: [{ pk, status, student, graduated, created_at, graduated_viewed_at, contact_shared_at }], page, size, total }

@enduml
